[ar:YOUA]
[ti:THE TENTH SEASON]
[al:THE TENTH SEASON (English Version)]
[length:03:02]
[00:00.60]If I move closer
[00:15.74]Like an old photograph
[00:17.37]Fading into view
[00:18.90]Same familiar smile
[00:20.67]The light I thought I knew
[00:23.17]Traces of the silence
[00:24.94]Lingering in your eyes
[00:25.96]Took the longest road
[00:28.10]Still you feel like home
[00:30.09]Now a frozen heart
[00:31.49]Starts to beat again
[00:33.76]Like a gentle tide
[00:36.04]Drifting back to you
[00:37.76]If I move closer
[00:39.33]Will you drift away?
[00:41.29]If I call your name
[00:42.96]Would you choose to stay?
[00:44.86]Ten long years gone
[00:46.63]Still I turn your way
[00:47.93]One step closer
[00:52.20]Don’t fade away
[00:57.31]Every whispered word
[00:58.98]Every quiet laugh
[01:01.21]Echoes in my mind
[01:02.88]Long after goodbye
[01:04.97]Thought I knew you well
[01:06.69]Now you feel so new
[01:08.55]Through the passing years
[01:10.22]I come back to you
[01:12.54]Maybe you feel it too
[01:14.12]Maybe you’re afraid
[01:16.07]We don’t have to rush
[01:17.65]Let’s just take it slow
[01:21.64]If I move closer
[01:23.50]Will you drift away?
[01:24.99]If I take your hand
[01:26.98]Would you choose to stay?
[01:29.16]Ten long years gone
[01:30.65]Still I turn your way
[01:32.79]Just one more step
[01:34.55]Could bring you back to me
[01:51.27]We lost all those years
[01:54.43]Yet something remains
[01:57.68]No need to name it now
[02:01.02]Just stay here with me
[02:07.99]If I move closer
[02:10.96]Don’t you drift away
[02:14.68]If I call your name
[02:17.83]Can this moment stay?
[02:27.54]Ten long years gone
[02:30.74]Still I turn your way
[02:35.30]One step closer
[02:39.01]This time, choose to stay
[02:41.80]Ten years have passed
[02:49.32]Yet time led me to you
[02:52.76]After all this time
[02:55.12]Still I’m drawn to you
